{"id": "2d9e8fbaf5087e9", "title": "阿坝州天牧牦牛乳业有限公司乳制品全品类配套包材供应商公开招募比选公告终止流标公告", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzyjy.sc.gov.cn/jyxx/002010/002010003/20260713/f6be79d4-94fb-4856-8989-083dc2b05724.html", "date": "2026-07-13", "source": "四川公共资源交易中心", "category": "002010003", "content": "阿坝州天牧牦牛乳业有限公司乳制品全品类配套包材供应商公开招募比选\n项\n目\n流标公告\n各潜在投标人、相关单位\n：\n我单位组织实施的\n【阿坝州天牧牦牛乳业有限公司乳制品全品类配套包材供应商公开招募比选\n项目\n】（项目编号：\nSWUEECG202641520\n） 项目采购（\n公开比选\n）工作，于\n2026\n年\n07\n月\n03\n日\n按规定流程开展招标\n/\n开标工作。\n根据本次项目实际开标及评审情况，\n1.\n截止\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n8\n日\n18\n时\n有效投标人不足三家，不满足法定开标条件；\n2\n.\n截止\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n10\n日\n18\n时\n投标文件实质性响应不足，不满足项目采购要求；\n特宣布\n本项目本次招标作流标处理。\n本次流标不影响项目后续采购安排，后续采购方式及重启时间将另行公告通知。\n特此公告。\n招标人：\n阿坝州天牧牦牛乳业\n有限公司\n联系电话：\n18582898268\n日期：\n2026\n年\n07\n月\n13\n日", "html": "<div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"newsText\"><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\";font-family:黑体;font-size:35px\">阿坝州天牧牦牛乳业有限公司乳制品全品类配套包材供应商公开招募比选</span></strong><strong><span style=\";font-family:黑体;font-size:35px\">项</span></strong><strong><span style=\";font-family:黑体;font-size:35px\">目</span></strong><strong><span style=\";font-family:黑体;font-size:35px\">流标公告</span></strong></h4><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">各潜在投标人、相关单位</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\">：</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px\"> </span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">我单位组织实施的</span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">【阿坝州天牧牦牛乳业有限公司乳制品全品类配套包材供应商公开招募比选</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">项目</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">】（项目编号：</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">SWUEECG202641520</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">） 项目采购（</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">公开比选</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）工作，于</span> </span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">年</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">07</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">月</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">03</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日</span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">按规定流程开展招标</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">开标工作。</span></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"> </span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">根据本次项目实际开标及评审情况，</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"> </span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1. </span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">截止</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">7</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">8</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">18</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">时</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">有效投标人不足三家，不满足法定开标条件；</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">. </span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">截止</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">7</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">18</span><span style=\"font-f